WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:38.750
We dodged
Mashymre's stubborn attack

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.880
thanks to the efforts of Roux in
the Core Base she brought.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:45.180
Still, if my Zeta Gundam
hadn't been there,

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.970
there's no telling what might
have happened to her.

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:51.930
Anyway, I'm glad
everyone's all right.

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:56.150
Fa ended up leaving us
 to go back to Kamille, though.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:02.000
ACTIVATION! DOUBLE ZETA

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:32.310
With that shield,
even the Zeta will be no match.

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:40.730
Can I help you?

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:43.530
That's a new weapon for
the Hamma-Hamma, isn't it?

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:47.950
Yes. This time, with that,
I'll pulverize the Zeta Gundam!

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:49.950
...said Mashymre!

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:52.830
End of story. This your reporter,
Chara Soon, signing off.

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:54.760
What is that?!

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:57.000
My report to Lady Haman.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:00.170
I'll also be reporting how many
mobile suits you let get destroyed.

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:02.180
Y-You can't!

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:04.560
Could you repeat that, please?

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:06.930
St-Stop that!

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:10.140
And so, Mashymre flees.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:13.140
God, just because she
has king-sized mounds--

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:17.080
Um, I mean she acts like
she's king of the mountain!

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:20.360
And what's Gottn
up to, anyway?!

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:22.740
Wha...?!

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:25.870
What? Whose...?!
Whose mobile suit is this?!

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:30.950
Sorry, sir!
Lady Chara Soon's orders, sir.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:34.380
What?!
That woman's a mobile suit pilot?!

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:40.330
Chara Soon, you're not
just a reporter, are you?!

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:44.040
No... I try to avoid piloting
mobile suits if I can.

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:47.430
Then don't bring a giant
mobile suit like this with you!

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:49.930
It's tough on the ones
who have to assemble it!

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:54.430
It's just I get excited and worn
out when I pilot a mobile suit.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:56.350
I don't enjoy it.

00:03:56.350 --> 00:04:00.410
And yet you're a pilot?
You don't find that a little strange?!

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:02.850
Women are complicated.

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:05.410
No, YOU'RE complicated!

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:11.870
No matter! I, Mashymre, can deal
with the Zeta Gundam by myself!

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:17.630
Mark those words and make
certain that Lady Haman sees them!

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:21.420
The mic's off.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:24.630
You are an awful woman.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:26.710
Come back here, you!

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:28.760
- Iino!
- Grab it!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:38.520
Would you calm down?!

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:39.900
Thank you, Judau.

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:42.140
Why didn't you tell the truth?!

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:43.150
About what?

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:47.450
It's Beecha and Mondo, right?
The collaborators the enemy mentioned.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.900
You're wrong.

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:51.380
Liar!

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:55.960
Iino. You can leave this for
Leina and the others, can't you?

00:04:56.720 --> 00:05:00.970
Look, my dad once told me...
You have to value your friends.

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:03.580
He told me you never,
ever betray them.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:06.170
And that's why you're
covering for them?!

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.920
But they're my friends...

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:10.550
Do you have that meat yet?
Oh...!

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:12.300
What are you two doing?!

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:14.840
- Here's your meat!
- Hey! Come back!

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:19.440
Don't you mind that Beecha and Mondo
could get us killed on a whim?!

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:26.820
Fa? Fa? Where is Fa?

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:31.150
Shut up!
Fa isn't here anymore!

00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:33.650
What's up, shrimps?

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:35.990
We can't take a break?

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:38.830
So, this is Fa's room?
Oh?

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:42.540
I've wanted a mirror like this.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:44.430
I think I'll take it.

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:45.540
Don't!

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:47.720
That's Fa's!

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.880
She'll miss that mirror
when she comes back!

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.210
Give it back!

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:53.420
Coming back?

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:54.300
Elle.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:55.770
Roux.

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:59.360
You have no tact at all.
You're like a little kid.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:03.020
This is an emergency! We don't have
time to get all mopey!

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:07.230
That's why I was trying to
get a rise out of Shinta and Qum!

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:12.570
So you do have some sensitivity.
But she has a point. Do you see that?

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:14.890
We're not mopey!

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.370
Yeah.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:21.460
Fa, huh? She must have
been a really nice person.

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:24.450
Huh?! We're sneaking off
the Argama?!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.120
Someone will hear you!

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.750
We'll go to Shangri-La
and bring Fa back!

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:29.890
And Kamille!

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:31.630
H-How do we get there?

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:36.190
There's a launch on the
lowest deck. We'll use that!

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:38.640
And who'd fly it?

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:40.270
Yeah...

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.360
Little boy! Little girl!

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:51.440
If you're going to Shangri-La,
please take me with you.

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:52.940
An enemy?

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:55.400
Why should we have to
take you with us?

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:59.200
Look, I don't want
to be your enemy.

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:01.120
That's my commander's fault.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:05.420
His name's Mashymre Cello,
and he's just a hopeless, awful man!

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:12.840
- You didn't want to fight against us?
- Right, right!

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:14.710
I've been thinking that...

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:17.840
I should quit this life and
go live quietly on Shangri-La.

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:19.180
Oh...?

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:23.850
So, please! I'll fly a launch or a
mobile suit or anything you like!

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:26.770
That's right! You're a pilot!

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:27.770
Of course.

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:29.070
Shinta!

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:32.730
Hang on!
We'll get the key!

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:34.620
Sure thing, kids!

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:39.080
Yes! I did it!

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:47.580
The elevator ahead
goes to the lower decks.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:52.250
Say, maybe we should use
the mobile suit deck, instead.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:53.960
Use the core fighter?

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:57.630
No! If we take that,
it'll weaken the Argama!

00:07:57.630 --> 00:08:00.260
It's on the mobile-suit deck, right?

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:02.050
What're you doing?! That hurts!

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:03.480
Hey, you!

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:08.480
He's escaping!

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:11.810
He's not escaping!
We're going to Shangri-La!

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:14.200
What are you talking about?!

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:17.450
This way! Hurry!

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:20.170
Be quiet!

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:21.830
Don't!

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:23.910
Stay back!

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:25.240
What are you doing?!

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:27.330
Keep back!
Don't come any closer!

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:28.510
Iino!

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:30.410
Clear the way!

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:34.300
Don't follow me!

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:42.140
Outta the way!

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:44.890
- Out.
- Wh-What's...?!

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.560
Can't you tell?

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:51.770
Complicated...

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:54.600
Move a finger
and I'll slice your face!

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:57.520
The Argama
won't open the hatch for you!

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:00.240
That's why I have you with me.

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:03.080
He's going to escape
in the core fighter?

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:05.370
Move!

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:07.290
What? Judau?

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:11.380
Judau, stop!
Don't agitate him any more!

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:17.940
- Then what do we do, Captain?
- Captain! The core fighter isn't armed!

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:20.680
We'll wait and see for now!

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:25.060
Beecha! There's some kind
of trouble down below.

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:37.580
I hate chicken!
You got that?!

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:40.360
It's a white-fish burger.

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:42.570
Fish? I guess that's okay.

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:45.740
But the normal suits
come first, right?

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:49.910
Nice and obedient, huh?

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:51.620
What's going on, Judau?

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.330
Shut up and watch!

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:54.830
Here. Your food.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:55.960
Put it in.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.460
It's your favorite...

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.450
CHICKEN!

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.220
Iino, hurry!

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:07.370
Come on, Iino!

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.270
Pull him, Leina!

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:13.070
Idiot.

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:15.740
I should've done it myself.

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:20.150
Hello? This is to my
comrades aboard the Argama!

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:22.320
I'm in danger!

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:26.110
Please, comrades!
Show yourselves and aid me!

00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:27.070
"Comrades"?

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:30.430
Ow! Stop it! Why, you...!

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:32.840
Where did they go?

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:36.040
- You know which circuit opens the hatch?
- Yeah!

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:40.470
If we don't get him out of here,
there's no telling what he'll say!

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:42.090
Roger!

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.630
Don't open the hatch!

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:45.350
I said I understand!

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:48.260
Is he all right?

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:50.350
It won't kill him!
Just do it!

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:51.400
Okay!

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:56.520
What...?!
Who said to open the hatch?!

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:58.650
All hands,
retreat to the air locks!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.200
It has to be
Beecha and Mondo.

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:05.030
Out of my way! Lemme go!

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:13.170
I swear I'll catch him!
Hang on, Iino!

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:17.550
Roux Louka, moving out.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:26.630
I didn't think it would work.

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:30.260
Mister, let me put on
a normal suit, too.

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:31.690
Here.

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:36.020
I can't wear it like this!
Untie me!

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.020
No way.

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:40.560
I can't let my guard down
with you. I'll get it on.

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:43.400
No! It's impossible!

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:47.370
There. It's on, isn't it?

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:16.750
In that AEUG normal suit, that's...!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:19.920
What?! Can that be...?!

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.600
Gottn? Is that Gottn?

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:27.280
Lord Mashymre! You came for me!

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:30.410
Personally! Personally!

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:32.640
Lord Mashymre!

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:35.270
Ugh! How sickening!

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.640
Gottn, do you know the
Argama's direction?

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.080
He's aboard!

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:41.760
Right! Let's go!

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:51.430
Huh? No one's here.
What happened?

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.970
Looks like they hit a
rock and got thrown out.

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:56.710
No... Where'd they go?!

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.690
IINO!

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:00.980
Captain!

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.870
Possible mobile suits
approaching from astern!

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:05.400
Axis?

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:06.790
I can't tell.

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.240
Recall the Zeta!

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:16.190
If Gottn's information is correct,
I'm just dealing with the Zeta alone.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:20.130
Just watch, Lady Haman.
This time...

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:21.830
And that woman!

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:25.380
After she said she'd come
see me fight, what's she doing?!

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:34.930
There's no enemy here, but...!

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:41.190
Mobile suits make me...
Make me...!

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:44.650
Oh, it's no use!
It's no use!

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:49.990
I can't breathe! I'm dying!

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:51.860
I'm dying!

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:54.040
Then please, do so!
Let's go!

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:01.390
- Judau still isn't back?
- He's en route!

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:05.300
Contact the La Vie en Rose!
Ask for reinforcements!

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:16.930
So, you're awake.

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:20.910
Relax. This is the
La Vie en Rose.

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:22.600
The La Vie en Rose?

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:25.140
You're lucky we found
you floating in space.

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:26.440
I think so, too.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:28.020
Is that a Core Base?

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:31.980
No, the Core Top. The final
part of our new mobile suit.

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:34.190
New mobile suit?

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:38.110
Didn't Roux Louka tell you?
About the Gundam Double Zeta.

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:40.880
Gundam Double Zeta?!

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:47.130
A new weapon for the AEUG, made with
the full resources of Anaheim Electronics.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:50.670
Deputy Captain! The Argama
is apparently under attack!

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:51.720
The Argama?!

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:56.810
This is for Iino!
Say your prayers!

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:04.400
The Zeta!

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:06.940
Have at you!

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:11.270
Fall!

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:13.370
I have you, boy!

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:20.370
What's that weapon?!

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:26.140
I did it! The new weapon
is a resounding success!

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:28.090
Judau, grab on!

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:32.890
You flee, Zeta Gundam?!

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:36.010
Judau, you don't
have to die, too.

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:38.440
Who said anyone was dead?!

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:39.800
Judau!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:42.180
At this rate, the Argama
will be destroyed!

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:44.760
Hang on till I get the
new suit for you, Judau!

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:46.970
The Argama's finished!

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:49.020
We gotta jump ship to the Endra!

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:50.480
Can you fly this?

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:53.100
It's like a Petit Mobile Suit!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:55.790
Hey, who told you to take off?!

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:56.750
What happened?

00:15:56.750 --> 00:16:00.490
Someone's in the core fighter
that's last in line to be resupplied.

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:02.000
Is it armed?

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:05.030
Shove over more!

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:07.080
I can't make any more room!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:08.550
Let's go!

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:12.750
Agh! We're flying!

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:15.890
That was the plan!
Don't act so surprised!

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:19.310
- Beecha!
- What?!

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:26.930
My body's hot!
It's burning up! I'm hot!

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:28.220
We're gonna die!

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:29.690
I'm scared!

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:35.280
No, you don't!

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:40.530
This is why
I hate mobile suits!

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:42.250
What?

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:52.170
Not bad!

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:57.140
Because of you...!
Because of mobile suits...!

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:59.140
I hate you!

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:04.600
She... She's gone.

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.190
DIE, ZETA!

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:15.730
My body...!
My body's burning!

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:17.360
Lemme go!

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:20.400
That's it, Chara!
Just hold him!

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:23.110
Zeta! Rest in peace!

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:30.950
I did it!

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:32.300
I did it!

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:35.170
Lady Haman!
At last, I've done it!

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:41.560
The auxiliary cameras
are offline, too!

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:44.390
Why can't I move?!

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:51.480
The core fighter.

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:55.240
What's he doing?

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.240
Mondo! Beecha!
You came for me?

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:04.870
Kinda tight in here.

00:18:07.050 --> 00:18:09.990
Fleeing in that toy plane?

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:16.430
Huh?

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:19.790
This is Roux Louka!
La Vie en Rose, please respond.

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:21.800
- Is that you, Roux?
- Yes!

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:24.970
That kid Iino is in the Core Top!
Give him support!

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:26.100
Iino?

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:34.100
Judau, do something!

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:37.140
Put your head down!
I can't see in front of me!

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:41.240
Once I take that out,
all that remains is the Argama!

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:43.160
Let's hit them!

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:44.740
What?!

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:48.050
My soul! My soul throbs!

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:51.130
My soul is one that
charges through space!

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:53.120
It charges through space!

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:55.020
SO WHAT?!

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:56.880
Unhand me, you fool!

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:05.280
Is it another enemy?

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:07.550
No. It's a new kind
of Core Base!

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:08.810
New kind?

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:13.200
Who's in there?

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:16.220
It's me! Judau!
They got the Zeta!

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:17.940
Judau, you're okay?!

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:19.600
Iino! Iino, is that you?

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:20.480
Judau!

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:22.070
Judau, here he comes!

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.980
Roux, get me in that new model!

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:26.990
Judau, listen carefully.

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:30.530
The core fighter you're in
is part of the new suit!

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:32.870
What, this little thing?

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:34.870
I'll explain later. Follow me!

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:35.700
Understood!

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:37.290
Beecha, Mondo! Get out!

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:38.040
Why?!

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:39.370
You're in the way!

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:40.630
How do we get out?

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:41.790
Just go!

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:43.540
But it's coming!

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:46.210
If you get shot,
you die either way!

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:48.180
What are they doing?

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:56.100
What do I do?

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:58.060
Pull the red lever on your right!

00:19:58.060 --> 00:20:00.530
Red lever? This one?

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:06.990
What's that supposed
to accomplish?

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:14.920
What? They're docking?!

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:24.260
I don't care how
complicated it is!

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:33.800
Trying to surprise me?!
So, it transformed into a mobile suit?!

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:35.600
Our newest mobile suit...

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.560
Double Zeta!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:45.450
This is... Double Zeta!

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:47.780
Wait... Where's the enemy?!

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:52.820
So what if it transforms
and docks all at once?!

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:56.780
You think that will make
me turn tail and run?!

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:02.460
It... It's fast!

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:06.890
I'll cut you in two, Mashymre!

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:35.910
What power!

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:45.670
Whoa, that was intense!
I am a storm of emotion!

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:48.210
Have you ever seen anything
as powerful as the Double Zeta?!

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:50.380
You did it, Judau!
That was amazing!

00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:53.020
Hey, Judau!
Not bad, huh?

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:56.740
- That was awesome, Judau!
- That's gonna make us a fortune!

00:21:56.740 --> 00:22:00.890
What do you expect?
It had me piloting it, after all.

00:22:00.890 --> 00:22:05.110
With this thing,
ol' Mashymre is toast!

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:09.230
Is that the new suit from
the La Vie en Rose? Judau's piloting it?!

00:22:09.230 --> 00:22:10.900
Judau, you're great!

00:22:10.900 --> 00:22:13.490
Uh-huh! Just like
we thought he was!

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:17.700
Yes, but it looks like an
overly complex machine.

00:22:17.700 --> 00:22:19.330
How will he master it?

00:22:19.330 --> 00:22:22.240
That is a problem.
He gets carried away so easily.

00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:23.750
It's not just that, though.

00:22:45.850 --> 00:22:51.520
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:58.740
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:03.240
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:09.540
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:16.630
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:21.050
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:23.430
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:33.650
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:46.950 --> 00:23:49.900
Even though we finally made
contact with the La Vie en Rose,

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:52.780
that lady officer on the
Endra isn't taking it easy on us.

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:56.030
Her R-Jarja manages to
catch the Double Zeta!

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:59.780
But what's this feeling?

00:23:59.780 --> 00:24:03.800
While this feeling is confusing me,
Leina is...! What?!

00:24:03.800 --> 00:24:07.920
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Leina Vanishes."

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:10.580
Dammit, Roux! Are you all talk?!

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
LEINA VANISHES

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
Next Time
